          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akoloŋit ŋin, isitiyae nabo Ekapolon apedor keŋ kinyaku ŋipiya a ŋituŋa keŋ alo Asiriya, alo Ijipit, alo Pasiros, alo Esiopia, alo Elam, alo Sinar, alo Amas ka anakwapin a ŋuna idunyito anam.",
          "type": "text",
